{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":60846,\"title\":\"Log Horizon\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"One day, while playing the online game Elder Tales, 30,000 players suddenly find themselves trapped in another world. There, eight-year veteran gamer Shiroe also gets left behind. The trapped players are still alive, but they remain in combat with the monsters. The players don't understand what has happened to them, and they flee to Akiba, the largest city in Tokyo, where they are thrown into chaos. Once proud of his loner lifestyle, Shiroe forms a guild called Log Horizon with his old friend Naotsugu, female assassin Akatsuki and others.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xLGdRuWCn2AlByL5Y9OLB3ZwItg.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/73bAnTfBQpgIN7EBinQhnlZViM2.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":207,\"year\":2013,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":62,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"NHK Educational TV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2021-03-31\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1772523,\"name\":\"Junichi Wada\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2381347,\"name\":\"Takashi Ando\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1795403,\"name\":\"Noriaki Saito\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1154613,\"name\":\"Takaaki Ishiyama\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tJomybhCMhxUebzpbcXotKy55qA.jpg\"},{\"id\":1649345,\"name\":\"Kazunobu Fuseki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2208431,\"name\":\"Tsuyoshi Tobita\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1647531,\"name\":\"Yasuo Iwamoto\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3263499,\"name\":\"Akira Koremoto\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2562541,\"name\":\"Toshinori Watanabe\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7J24ZeJ6Dp6QFXfnXxHqGOUxm96.jpg\"},{\"id\":1901653,\"name\":\"Takanori Yano\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1145726,\"name\":\"Yukihiro Matsushita\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2043584,\"name\":\"Yoshito Hata\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1135742,\"name\":\"Kenichi Maejima\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":222350,\"name\":\"Takuma Terashima\",\"character\":\"Shiroe (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5uCihb318AzQCT9gieMlI2ueYL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1249235,\"name\":\"Tomoaki Maeno\",\"character\":\"Naotsugu (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w3lEuXSbEyzzNyO3YnxsF6wm2N5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1157126,\"name\":\"Emiri Kato\",\"character\":\"Akatsuki (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m0zqjeg65sEe5TTy4mKqgwXVipI.jpg\"},{\"id\":23987,\"name\":\"Jouji Nakata\",\"character\":\"Nyanta (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wYhv4BtQnc6bZp2Qnh6GiYjmNKC.jpg\"},{\"id\":1325962,\"name\":\"Daiki Yamashita\",\"character\":\"Tohya (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rQNdJdZewk7VGP16ZNbpfJ9ZeMd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1325963,\"name\":\"Nao Tamura\",\"character\":\"Minori (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zZKM9EU769hEiQWcQWkT9AAPFp9.jpg\"},{\"id\":1325964,\"name\":\"Eriko Matsui\",\"character\":\"Isuzu (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/atMgu6hwHQisLA2tK8aVmevZYh6.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"IG1VhJ75r8k\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"58q1H5IjRv0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"hhDjePuzHdc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":94693,\"title\":\"Wandering Witch: The Journey of Elaina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gR0qwFa17c6xHnIauHrpgRJKiaH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42177419354838713,\"_genreOverlap\":4},{\"id\":312522,\"title\":\"My Ribdiculous Reincarnation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cMWbu2oD199St13sQEIxBMGzPHV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41034482758620694,\"_genreOverlap\":4},{\"id\":94649,\"title\":\"Infinite Dendrogram\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ePUz7Zq1SRLhNWvaeQYm2oPj5H7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.3252100840336135,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":60667,\"title\":\"Gundam Build Fighters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzvm78n4yOmeO2FdtD2aAbjDTuG.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.3241071428571429,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":60682,\"title\":\"Macross Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pGEIhZSwpy7nqQTIJu5nmGD66pc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.31858407079646023,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":128237,\"title\":\"Legend of Mana -The Teardrop Crystal-\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ls6XvZQqrGgbaJRw6ulsJVzfi3.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.3132743362831859,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":128255,\"title\":\"Transformers: War for Cybertron: Kingdom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1HQEdk7gsLvECRzycwxW2m0o4xW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.30731707317073176,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":94605,\"title\":\"Arcane\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/87C0wecB8bHb1PsrKBI4kJiEkgV.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.306896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":60663,\"title\":\"Buddy Complex\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2JVwRxQEWVhehgzZblNfRe8zvHn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21250000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":60672,\"title\":\"Recently, My Sister is Unusual\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rkoE7RxkBXuTfGUA6HwQ1DQftDc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21250000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":281044,\"title\":\"Solo Camping for Two\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r1UVwYCQ4q02T40bdnRgTFLkOXc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2111111111111111,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":281058,\"title\":\"Secrets of the Silent Witch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2qqAiyfpVdY8qEtxBeNYKreS4t.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21081081081081082,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"One day, while playing the online game Elder Tales, 30,000 players suddenly find themselves trapped in another world. There, eight-year veteran gamer Shiroe also gets left behind. The trapped players are still alive, but they remain in combat with the monsters. The players don't understand what has happened to them, and they flee to Akiba, the largest city in Tokyo, where they are thrown into chaos. Once proud of his loner lifestyle, Shiroe forms a guild called Log Horizon with his old friend Naotsugu, female assassin Akatsuki and others.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dgz6izdLxeOxD1A3wneye889yA7.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2013-10-05\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The Apocalypse\",\"overview\":\"Out of nowhere, Shiroe finds himself in the city of Akihabara, inside the game \\\"Elder Tale\\\". Thirty thousand Japanese players have been locked inside the game! The world on the other side of the screen becomes reality, and amidst the chaos Shiroe finds his old friend Naotsugu. And as they relax at finding one another, they meet the powerful assassin \\\"Akatsuki\\\". Akatsuki has a request to make of Shiroe...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qBMIWMhOL7NRzLkPRQUyz3g1vhE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-05\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Roka Encounter Battle\",\"overview\":\"The Apocalypse has locked thirty thousand players inside the game, and no one knows what to do. The larger guilds are taking over Akihabara, and outside the city violent groups are Party Killing other players. A young female member of Marielle's \\\"Crescent Moon Alliance\\\" is trapped in Susukino, far to the north, and needs their help. Shiroe feels somewhat embarrassed, but makes a decision.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A1calScM9oWB7AWa8BLanVeu4nv.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-12\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Depths of Palm\",\"overview\":\"Serara, a young female member of the guild \\\"Crescent Moon Alliance\\\", is trapped by mysterious men in the northern city of Susukino and needs help. Shiroe and his friends travel to reach her. Annoyed by the game's tasteless food, they travel northwards, and go inside \\\"the depths of Palm\\\", a crumbling series of old mining tunnels. There they meet creepy monsters...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b2l6ymBVSQqwoxSh7ksIEs2eBrj.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-19\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Escape\",\"overview\":\"Shiroe, Naotsugu, and Akatsuki reach the northern city of Susukino, and safely meet Serara. With the help of the mysterious swashbuckler Nyanta, they plot to leave Susukino. But the evil guild Brigantia wants to stop them. The high-level monk Demikas attacks them. Can they overcome the odds?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dRYJwfWJtQ2hpkKvTaWC8OQnW8y.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-10-26\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Return to Akiba\",\"overview\":\"Shiroe and his group take Serara southwards. On the way, they stop at the house of one of the \\\"People of the Land\\\". The people of the land were originally only characters in the game, with no personalities or unique traits of their own, but as Naotsugu talks to them, something seems odd... The party gradually realizes that the world isn't the same as it was when it was a game.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eweF0GIqAK5l5E9TRIscQbqnBqf.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-02\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Resolve\",\"overview\":\"Shiroe returns to Akihaba and Marielle tells him what the town is like. The initial chaos has subsided, but the larger guilds are in control, and evil guilds are tricking new players and taking advantage of them. Shiroe is angred by this, and tells Naotsugu, Akatsuki, and Nyanta of his plan. And then he tells the Crescent Moon Alliance that he's going to clean up the city of Akihabara.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rqKPPIkRPc6WfumW6i6U2DPm9Pn.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-09\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Crescent Moon\",\"overview\":\"Nyanta told Shiroe the secret of making real food in this world. With Marielle's help, the Crescent Moon Alliance begins a fast food stand, and their \\\"Crescent Burger\\\" is hugely popular with players who are sick of tasteless food. BUt Shiroe's real goal isn't to sell hamburgers, and with Henrietta he begins to work on the next phase of his plan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/om3hLr5uVreMLf6mT8W0eiTWffc.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-16\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Villain in Glasses\",\"overview\":\"After the success of their Crescent Burger, Marielle and Henrietta meet with the members of the major crafting guilds of Elder Tale: Karashin of Shopping Street 8, Michikata of the Marine Agency ,and Roderic of the Roderic Merchant Association. They use Shiroe's plan to dangle the secret recipe of the Crescent Burger in front of them, and the talented account Henrietta opens negotiations. What she wants is...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/spZEuOmFrE7mH0CUmUXxtLDfMfk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-23\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Round Table Conference\",\"overview\":\"To make the city of Akihabara safe, Shiroe calls all the major guild masters to the guild building. His goal is to create a Round Table Conference, which will rule the city. But everyone there wants something different, and his plan is about to go bad. What amazing trick does Shiroe have? Meanwhile, behind the scenes of the conference, the plan to free the younger players from the evil guild Hamelin continues. The strategist SHiroe's quiet battle in Akihabara continues!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2JopSzNEO8zve89zP6dnnLPRWY.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-11-30\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Get It With Your Own Hands\",\"overview\":\"Shiroe confronts the 10 guild masters who represent Akihabara with the need to revitalize the town and bring peace and order. His calm and forceful manner brings them over, and the government of Akihabara, the \\\"Round Table\\\", is founded. After this work is done, his guild, \\\"Log Horizon\\\", joyously moves to their new location. That night, Nyanta fixes them his special curry.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1CdKsq0sXqmCWOYwB9yPkncxHVF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-07\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Invitation from Eastal\",\"overview\":\"The Free Cities of Eastel are the first to notice the founding of the Round Table. They send a messenger to Akihabara and invite Shiroe and Crusty to their conference. What are the nobles planning at their ice-covered palace? Meanwhile, Minori and Touya and the other new playesr are going on a camping trip at the beach to learn to fight. Marielle forgets her role as leader (?) and enjoys the salt air fun.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ratq8egmpdldzJTOewVYOY9CwTi.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-14\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Laglanda Forest\",\"overview\":\"The young players travel the Xantleaf peninsula at the camp. Minori, Touya and Serara meet up with new players Isuzu the bard and Rundel Haus the sorcerer. They head into the \\\"La Granda Forest\\\" dungeon, where skeletons await them. The easily-spooked Serara, the strong-willed Touya, and the proud Rundel Haus... will the five of them be able to work together in their first party fight?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9zyhrRDTc3z2qXXrqVlMyAjATuO.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-21\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"The Shield and Freedom\",\"overview\":\"Shiroe, Crusty, and Michitaka are invited to the palace by the Free Cities of Eastel. The nobles of the land invite the three of them to various meetings and seem to be trying to find out more about Akihabara and the Round Table. Crusty is attracted to the daughter of Duke Cowen, who is noble, beautiful, but seems somehow lazy...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hrR6a8zXFO55Z6iRvspfySGAoNe.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-12-28\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"World Fraction\",\"overview\":\"Shiroe and Akatsuki are invited to the room of the mysterious mage Reagan. Shiroe is shocked at the revelations he offers about the world of Elder Tale.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/blfO8e9eB4VMdcTfTngBCJWVayP.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-04\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Attack\",\"overview\":\"Touya and Minori and the rest of the players in the training camp are hitting a wall with the way they fight. And Minori's suggestion is that they introduce themselves to one another!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rDD5ow3fIcRHdVHv4M44pviruKs.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-11\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Return of the Goblin King\",\"overview\":\"Just as the Sahaugin attack begins on the Zantleaf peninsula, the goblins are seen advancing further inland. Will they attack Laynessia's homeland, Maihama, or Akihabari?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lESqlbqBmD2Y2JZc09PjnDTocX8.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-18\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"A Lazy, Cowardly Princess\",\"overview\":\"The lords of the Free Cities of Eastal begin an emergency conference to discuss the goblin invasion. The protectors of the land people, the Izumo Knights, are missing, and they'll have to depend on the adventurers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ivTGTYM2x6CyQGNHmOhgWnUMitw.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-01-25\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Expeditionary Force\",\"overview\":\"Princess Laynessia Cowen vows to go to the city of Akihabara herself and beg the adventurers for help against the goblins. The members of the Crescent Moon Alliance can't conceal their excitement at meeting a real princess.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eTcj2sLLIy45doLn6yiojfjO4Ji.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-01\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Chasing After Them\",\"overview\":\"Zantleaf is attacked by monsters from both the land and the sea, as the adventurers continue to defend it. Inland, Crusty's army launches a raid on the goblin's main force. At the town of Choushi by the sea, the new players are fighting too.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8u9nAlOZLRux40s5EWZ891v095Q.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-08\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Contract\",\"overview\":\"Rundelhaus hid from his friends that he was one of the land people, but the price of fighting off the dire wolves was that he took a fatal wound. If they can't save him, he'll die and he won't revive.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zNZGmwZebxvWim7daQh8vlhkHvR.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-15\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Waltz for Two\",\"overview\":\"A victory party is held at the palace of Eternal Ice to celebrate the adventurer's defeat over the monsters. Crusty takes the princess's hand and leads her in a dance signifying the reconciliation between the adventurers and land people.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nvIUxe0XW4N2z7BQniJ4Lpnagtq.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-02-22\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"The Swallow and the Baby Starling\",\"overview\":\"Fall has come to Akihabara. After defeating the monsters, Shiroe is fighting a losing battle against paperwork, but the town is filled with cheer as the first event the Adventurers have ever had, the \\\"Scales Festival\\\", is approaching.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1iyrIikJYnt9x8FRKDLrCTBd6A8.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-01\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"The Apprentice Magician\",\"overview\":\"The second day of the Scales Festival in Akihabara arrives. Akatsuki has gotten closer to Shiroe, and so is very happy all day, and even seems to be enjoying her fights with Naotsugu. Meanwhile, Minori is uncertain with how to deal with her feelings towards him, and goes to speed to Karashin. Karashin is overloaded with paperwork so she decides to help. It seems like a lot of land people merchants have come to Akihabara...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4MEpmmhvjdyBFSEOOGUk77JAeUM.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-08\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Confusion\",\"overview\":\"Akihabara is amazingly busy since the Scales Festival began. There are many land people in town, causing accidents, spreading rumors, and starting couples' fights, and even Shiroe can't deal with them. An influential noble named Marves arrives from Minami to see Laynessia. Laynessia tries her best to deal with him, but he gets closer and closer to her...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4TQTgNwTI00cfyjJC2W4vLPQF84.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-15\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"The Libra Festival\",\"overview\":\"Marielle and Henrietta put on a fashion show as the town reels from the Minami decoy operation. Akatsuki walks down the runway in her colorful clothes, but Shiroe is nowhere to be seen. That night, Shiroe is met by a beautiful and enchanting \\\"queen of darkness.\\\" Shiroe is tempted he reaches the heart of the conspiracy...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zYqouuva2rBVAp58aF6X4ju0mNZ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-22\",\"runtime\":25}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2013-10-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}